---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for interpretBoundaries. Read the supplied reporting framework, organizational boundary, and amendments to determine included activities and required measures. Distinguish ownership, operational control, and other supplied boundary concepts rather than choosing whichever yields a favorable result. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
